WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.440
(off camera) That does sound like us.

00:00:02.440 --> 00:00:03.580
All right we're rolling

00:01:24.880 --> 00:01:25.720
no that's it it's actually an,

00:01:26.180 --> 00:01:27.300
that's actually an intersection

00:01:39.780 --> 00:01:41.660
specifically engineered merge

00:01:53.720 --> 00:01:54.960
so we're standing here trying to figure

00:01:54.960 --> 00:01:56.920
out where the construction beeps coming
from

00:02:05.660 --> 00:02:08.080
well, don't know where you've been but I hope you had fun out there

00:02:09.340 --> 00:02:12.100
Wheee!  Go get 'em! [clapping]

00:02:13.620 --> 00:02:14.260
Woo-hoo!

00:03:42.100 --> 00:03:43.800
That was a little close.

00:03:45.320 --> 00:03:46.220
Were they close?

00:04:07.000 --> 00:04:08.480
We do this very often

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:11.780
There must be something there we don't like

00:04:42.260 --> 00:04:46.000
we normally stop over here so Stanford
might actually catch us

00:04:52.220 --> 00:04:56.040
well, it's a long discussion and not one I
want to have here

00:04:57.800 --> 00:05:00.700
I think we're having issues with shadows, personally

00:05:03.020 --> 00:05:04.880
come on let's go keep going

00:05:05.520 --> 00:05:07.240
I think that might have been a lane change

00:05:09.420 --> 00:05:10.060
Off we go

00:05:10.780 --> 00:05:14.300
That's fine, whatever. I mean, it doesn't, you don't get beauty or style points

00:05:14.900 --> 00:05:16.440
Well, actually, you do (laughs)

00:05:17.380 --> 00:05:23.180
That comment was from Nick. Thanks Nick for your support (laughter)

00:05:26.380 --> 00:05:28.520
Coming up the rotary. I'm standing at the top of the rotary.

00:05:30.960 --> 00:05:32.300
Here it comes. Coming right by me.

00:06:07.840 --> 00:06:09.980
John I have a visual it's at the top

00:06:11.100 --> 00:06:12.240
Yep, he's at the top. I have a visual

00:06:44.340 --> 00:06:48.780
Still stopping for reasons that aren't clear. There's nobody else around anymore.

00:06:51.220 --> 00:06:54.280
Traffic vehicles up ahead, interesting

00:07:13.040 --> 00:07:14.440
[clapping]

00:07:43.020 --> 00:07:43.740
Excellent

00:07:44.900 --> 00:07:46.720
[cheering and applause]

00:07:50.140 --> 00:07:50.660
Yes!

